  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-02-25T04:03:45.109Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please allow us to make it so that we can set parameters on our avatars to not be controllable through OSC. \nRight now OSC can override any kind of security measure we have in our avatars, by simply triggering a parameter. Allow us to set certain parameters to not be drivable through OSC. Or make it so we can dissable it FOR THE AVATAR all together. \n\nSo when people force clone our avatars they can't just circumvent the features or security measures we have in place or have purposfully dissabled in the radial menu.",
